...@../../../dev/d2/themes/sequence
# W02: selected success schedule; failure and evidence axes are separate views.
shape: sequence_diagram
adapter: Protocol adapter
coord: Rust coordination service
scheme: Serialized Scheme owner
issuer: Rust grant authority
ledger: Durable ledger
adapter -> coord: Frozen authenticated operation
coord -> ledger: S1 Prepare holds and pending flow
ledger -> coord: Durable Prepared and cut V
coord -> scheme: S2 Authorize exact admitted request
scheme -> issuer: Trusted source-bound evaluation
issuer -> issuer: Complete matching witnesses\nError-free execution gate required
issuer -> scheme: Signed receipt and grant
scheme -> coord: Bound local lifecycle grant
coord -> scheme: S3 Reserve local grant once
scheme -> coord: Local reservation / no effect
coord -> ledger: Persist exact ConsumePending command
ledger -> coord: Durable pending acknowledgment
coord -> scheme: Deliver reservation once
scheme -> scheme: Validate qualified finite source lease
scheme -> coord: Configured synchronous delivery callback\nSeparate bounded coordinator task
coord -> issuer: Consume original grant and exact subject
issuer -> coord: Authenticated positive consumption
coord.caveat: "S1-S3 ends with positive consume knowledge, not permission to send.\nContinue at W10. Qualified finite lease; no callback into the blocked Scheme owner."
# Shared role accents; brand marks are confined to architecture headers.
adapter.class: cloud
coord.class: runtime
scheme.class: semantic
issuer.class: policy
ledger.class: ledger
coord.caveat.class: note

